{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24737","headline":"酬令狐留守尚书见赠十韵 · 白居易","name":"酬令狐留守尚书见赠十韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长庆清风在，夔龙燮理余。\n太和膏雨降，周邵保厘初。\n嵩少当宫署，伊瀍入禁渠。\n晓关开玉兔，夕钥纳银鱼。\n旧眷怜移疾，新吟念索居。\n离声双白鹂，行色一篮轝。\n罢免无余俸，休闲有敝庐。\n慵於嵇叔夜，渴似马相如。\n酒每蒙酤我，诗尝许起予。\n洛中归计定，一半爲尚书。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24737.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24737","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}